WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.666
Video twenty-three. Users, passwords,
security, and the Edit Log.

00:00:05.866 --> 00:00:09.751
The owner turns on security, and makes a user
for each person.

00:00:09.681 --> 00:00:13.764
Each user has a role, and logs in with a name
and a password.

00:00:13.694 --> 00:00:17.579
The Edit Log keeps every change, with the user
and the time.

00:00:17.878 --> 00:00:21.494
Alt+K opens the Company menu. Y is Security.

00:00:21.524 --> 00:00:25.807
Set Control User Access to Yes. The owner is
the administrator.

00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:32.054
Press Ctrl+A. Then Hisaab asks for the owner's
password, two times. Keep it in a safe place.

00:00:33.134 --> 00:00:37.686
Alt+K, P opens Users and Passwords. Alt+C
makes a user.

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:44.614
Pick the role Data Entry, and type the name. Data Entry makes
vouchers and masters, and cannot open security.

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:49.062
Ctrl+A asks for the user's password. Now priya
is in the list.

00:00:54.894 --> 00:00:57.377
Ctrl+F3 shuts the company.

00:00:58.076 --> 00:01:03.292
Alt+F3 opens it again. Hisaab asks for the
name and the password, every time.

00:01:06.076 --> 00:01:10.693
Priya logs in. Her Company menu has no
Security and no Users.

00:01:15.126 --> 00:01:18.410
Priya opens the Day Book, and selects the
payment.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:23.096
She changes the amount from 30,000 to 18,500.

00:01:23.797 --> 00:01:27.347
Ctrl+A saves it. The Day Book shows the new
amount.

00:01:27.377 --> 00:01:32.194
Alt+Q in the voucher shows its Edit Log: priya
altered the payment, and the time.

00:01:34.377 --> 00:01:39.395
Alt+K, L lists the changes to the company
itself, with the user and the time.

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:44.686
Give each person a user. The Edit Log keeps
every change.

00:01:44.616 --> 00:01:47.035
Next: the office network.

